# A pad, through SDL's own virtual joystick: the left stick walks, the right stick turns at the
# game's look rate, the right trigger fires.
2 pad attach
10 pad axis leftStickY 1
70 pad axis leftStickY 0
80 pad axis rightStickX 1
110 pad axis rightStickX 0
120 pad axis rightTrigger 1
125 pad axis rightTrigger 0
140 quit
